    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "トゲの　さきから　でんきを　はなつ。 するどい　はで　いわに　ついた かいそうを　こそいで　たべる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il libère de l’électricité depuis la pointe de ses épines, et se nourrit des algues accrochées aux rochers en les arrachant avec ses dents aiguisées.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "棘の　先から　電気を　放つ。 鋭い　歯で　岩に　ついた 海藻を　こそいで　食べる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "トゲの　１ぽん　１ぽんに　でんきを たくわえる。　おれた　トゲでも ３じかんは　ほうでんを　つづけるぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Chacune de ses épines est chargée en électricité. S’il en perd une, celle-ci continue d’émettre un courant électrique pendant trois heures.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It stores electricity in each spine. Even if one gets broken off, it still continues to emit electricity for at least three hours.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "棘の　１本　１本に　電気を 蓄える。　折れた　棘でも ３時間は　放電を　続けるぞ。",
        "language": {
